        <mxCell id="rooms" value="&lt;b&gt;Rooms&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Catalogue · Room(number, type)&lt;br&gt;RoomCatalog.all()&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Owns future price and maintenance rules." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;fontSize=15;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1">
