        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Business boundaries&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reservations coordinates the booking rule. Other contexts own their rules and state.&lt;br&gt;A response or future event does not imply a reverse Python import.&lt;br&gt;Pricing, maintenance, 30% deposits and durable delivery are design scope; see each contract’s P06 status." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;fontSize=15;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#b3b3b3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
